OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvercast with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, this locally heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent across the hills and
OL,8,Fmountains of north Wales. Risk of
OL,9,Fthunder and hail through the morning.
OL,10,FBecoming drier and brighter from the
OL,11,Fwest during the afternoon.
OL,12,FTemperatures around average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA dry night to come with
OL,15,Fplenty of clear spells and light
OL,16,Fwinds. Temperatures will drop quickly
OL,17,Fto low single figures in rural and
OL,18,Fsheltered spots. Grass frost likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
