OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FHazy sunny spells through
OL,6,Fmuch of Thursday and staying dry for
OL,7,Fall. Brighter sunshine later. Light
OL,8,Fwinds with temperatures around, or
OL,9,Fjust above average for the time of
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,13,Fmoves east on Friday. Brighter with
OL,14,Fshowers later, but staying around
OL,15,Faverage for temperatures. Unsettled
OL,16,Fconditions continue through the
OL,17,Fweekend with rain advancing eastwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
